{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Type Pressure</strong> is a <i>Bomb Party</i> inspired word/typing game where players must type words according to the prompt that is given while trying to rack up as high of a score as possible.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667360/extras/4a09f471ed8fef546e202b4bf2c8d91a.poster.avif?t=1749754658\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667360/extras/4a09f471ed8fef546e202b4bf2c8d91a.webm?t=1749754658\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667360/extras/4a09f471ed8fef546e202b4bf2c8d91a.mp4?t=1749754658\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Customization:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nearly all gameplay aspects can be fine-tuned to your preferences. Whether you want to disable word chaining, allow word repeats, or give yourself a little more time, each value can be easily adjusted before every game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667360/extras/6718edddfdcb52bda57d25c882e2cc92.poster.avif?t=1749754658\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667360/extras/6718edddfdcb52bda57d25c882e2cc92.webm?t=1749754658\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667360/extras/6718edddfdcb52bda57d25c882e2cc92.mp4?t=1749754658\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Challenges:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Type Pressure contains 10 unique challenges to test your vocabulary and typing skills!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Power Ups:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are 6 power ups that can be activated by typing one of their corresponding words. </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Heal: Restores 1 HP</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Freeze: Temporarily stops the clock</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reset: Clears your typed words, allowing already used words to be submitted again</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wildcard: Allows your next word to be any valid word</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Charge: Doubles the score of your next word</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Extend: Increases the time per word slightly</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Statistics:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >View all your previous games, typed words, and global high scores.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667360/extras/d34a8f47a034cdc64dd6913f91299fcb.poster.avif?t=1749754658\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667360/extras/d34a8f47a034cdc64dd6913f91299fcb.webm?t=1749754658\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667360/extras/d34a8f47a034cdc64dd6913f91299fcb.mp4?t=1749754658\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3667360?t=1749754658","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3667360?t=1749754658","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667360/8c1a8c77c8c5462460c7e90c39d026deb8e3c614/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1749754658","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667360/8c1a8c77